wordlist (https://github.com/wordnik/wordlist), copyright (c) 2020 Wordnik.

The upstream Wordnik game wordlist is licensed under the MIT License. Its
license text is included verbatim at licenses/WORDNIK_LICENSE. The vendored
source snapshot is retained at third_party/wordnik_wordlist/.

The source is filtered by tool/build_dictionary.dart with the documented
curation files under tool/curation/. This package does not claim that the
Wordnik source or the resulting list is exhaustive dictionary authority.
